OL,3,GNEWSAAnimal welfare and rehab site
OL,4,Amoves step closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPCA's plans to build a regional
OL,7,Fanimal welfare and rehabilitation
OL,8,Fcampus have come a step closer.
OL,10,FThe animal welfare charity is proposing
OL,11,Fto create what it describes as a
OL,12,F"one-stop shop" from rescue to recovery
OL,13,Ffor animals most in need on farmland
OL,14,Fclose to Pennington Flash in Leigh,
OL,15,FWigan.
OL,17,FThe charity said up to 150 jobs would
OL,18,Fbe based at the Mossley Hall site if
OL,19,Fapproved.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
